    <comment>Update to 0.84.2

One upstream release: fullscreen transcript search, configurable
default tools and fullscreen exit output, per-run themes, plus TUI
and model-selector fixes. The vendored dependency tree shrinks from
143 to 139 modules (Mistral SDK replaced by a native HTTP stream);
licence union unchanged. Local TW build green, rpmlint clean.</comment>
